## beautiful_prose

`account/claude/skills/beautiful_prose/`.

Vendored from https://github.com/SHADOWPR0/beautiful_prose, by SHADOWPR0. That
repository states no licence: it carries no LICENSE, COPYING or NOTICE file, and
GitHub shows no licence designation for it. The vendored copy carries no licence
text, no author line and no upstream reference either.

So this is redistributed with attribution but without stated permission, which
attribution does not grant. It is recorded here rather than left silent. If the
author would prefer it removed, or adds a licence that this repository cannot
satisfy, open an issue and it comes out of the payload.

## filesystem-context

`account/claude/skills/filesystem-context/`.

`SKILL.md` names "Agent Skills for Context Engineering Contributors" as author and
refers to sibling skills in a collection that is not present here. The tree carries
no licence, no LICENSE file and no upstream URL, so its origin is an author line and
nothing more.

Redistributed with attribution but without stated permission, on the same terms as
beautiful_prose above. If an author of that collection would prefer it removed, open
an issue and it comes out of the payload.

## Everything else

Everything else under `account/claude/` is original to this workstation: rules, agent
definitions, hooks, the statusline scripts, the Cringely Vale style, and the templated
`settings.account.json` and `mcp-servers.json`. Those are MIT under LICENSE with the
rest of the repository.
